write('padel-match-history/index.html', '''<!doctype html><html lang="en-GB"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Padel Match History, Search & Results Tracker | PadelWrist</title><meta name="description" content="Keep searchable padel Match History with PadelWrist. Filter by date, format, result and players, add notes and match details, and explore performance Insights."><meta name="robots" content="index,follow,max-image-preview:large,max-snippet:-1"><link rel="canonical" href="https://padelwrist.com/padel-match-history/"><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.png"><meta property="og:site_name" content="PadelWrist"><meta property="og:title" content="Searchable Padel Match History | PadelWrist"><meta property="og:description" content="Find old matches quickly, filter your history, add private notes and turn previous results into useful Insights."><meta property="og:type" content="website"><meta property="og:url" content="https://padelwrist.com/padel-match-history/"><meta property="og:image" content="https://padelwrist.com/assets/padelwrist-social-card.png"><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"><meta name="twitter:title" content="Searchable Padel Match History | PadelWrist"><meta name="twitter:description" content="Search, filter and enrich your padel results, then use Insights to understand the patterns across them."><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://padelwrist.com/assets/padelwrist-social-card.png"><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"WebPage","url":"https://padelwrist.com/padel-match-history/","name":"Padel Match History, Search & Results Tracker","description":"Searchable padel Match History and results tracking in PadelWrist.","dateModified":"2026-09-01","inLanguage":"en-GB","isPartOf":{"@id":"https://padelwrist.com/#website"},"about":{"@id":"https://padelwrist.com/#app"}},{"@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I search my padel match history?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. PadelWrist 1.4 lets you search and filter Match History by criteria including date, format, result and players."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I add notes to a padel match?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. You can add private notes and other match details such as match type and playing side."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can PadelWrist sync match history between devices?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Match history and saved players can sync privately through iCloud on supported Apple devices."}}]}]}</script><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/styles.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/launch.css"><script src="/assets/site.js" defer></script></head><body class="page-body"><a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a><header class="site-header solid"><div class="shell nav-wrap"><a class="brand" href="/"><span class="brand-mark">PW</span><span>PADELWRIST</span></a><nav class="site-nav"><a href="/">Home</a><a href="/guides/">Guides</a><a href="/support/">Support</a></nav></div></header><main id="main" class="content-page shell"><div class="page-heading reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Match History · PadelWrist 1.4</p><h1>Your padel history should become more useful over time.</h1><p>Every scored match is saved as something you can find, review and learn from later. Search and filter your results, add useful context and move naturally from one match into the bigger patterns in Insights.</p></div><article class="guide-copy"><section class="reveal"><h2>Search instead of scroll</h2><p>Once you have more than a handful of matches, a chronological list is not enough. PadelWrist 1.4 lets you search and filter Match History by date, format, result, players and other useful criteria so you can get back to the result you actually care about.</p></section><section class="reveal"><h2>Add the context the score cannot explain</h2><p>A 6-4, 6-3 result does not tell you whether it was a league match, a casual game or your first time playing on the left. Add match type, your playing side and private notes so the result still makes sense months later.</p></section><section class="reveal"><h2>Review, correct and resume</h2><p>You can revisit completed matches, correct saved set scores when something was entered incorrectly and resume unfinished matches rather than rebuilding them from the beginning.</p></section><section class="reveal"><h2>History feeds Insights</h2><p>Your history is the foundation for recent form, performance trends, partner and opponent records, head-to-head analysis and post-match milestones. The more accurately you score and identify players, the more useful those views become.</p><p><a href="/padel-player-statistics/">Explore PadelWrist Insights →</a></p></section><section class="reveal"><h2>Sync privately with iCloud</h2><p>Match history and saved players can sync privately through iCloud across supported Apple devices. You do not need to create a separate PadelWrist account just to keep your history available.</p></section><section class="reveal"><h2>Keep control of your records</h2><p>You can remove individual matches and clear stored history when you no longer want it. Private notes are there for your own context, not as content for a public profile.</p></section><section class="reveal"><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>Can I filter by player?</h3><p>Yes. Version 1.4 includes Match History search and filters covering players alongside date, format, result and more.</p><h3>Can I add notes after a match?</h3><p>Yes. Match details can include private notes, match type and your playing side.</p><h3>Does Match History work with Insights?</h3><p>Yes. Recorded matches provide the underlying data used for form, trends and player analysis.</p></section><aside class="guide-cta reveal"><h2>Score once. Use the result again.</h2><p>Start on Apple Watch, then use iPhone or iPad to search the result, add context and understand the pattern behind it.</p><a class="feedback-link" data-app-store-cta href="https://apps.apple.com/gb/app/padelwrist/id6799725420" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Get PadelWrist on the App Store</a></aside><nav class="related-guides reveal"><a href="/padel-player-statistics/">Insights & player analysis →</a><a href="/live-padel-score-iphone/">Live score on iPhone →</a><a href="/apple-watch-padel-scoring/">Apple Watch scoring →</a><a href="/whats-new/">What's new in 1.4 →</a></nav></article></main><footer class="site-footer"><div class="shell footer-grid"><div><a class="brand" href="/"><span class="brand-mark">PW</span><span>PADELWRIST</span></a></div><nav><a href="/guides/">Guides</a><a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a></nav><p>© <span data-year>2026</span> PadelWrist</p></div></footer></body></html>''')

